    "answer": {
      "short": "$240\\,\\mathrm{L}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}V &= Ah\\\\V &= (80\\times60)\\times50\\\\V &= 240\\,000\\,\\mathrm{cm}^3\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $1\\,\\mathrm{cm}^3=1\\,\\mathrm{mL}$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Capacity} &= 240\\,000\\,\\mathrm{mL}\\\\\\text{Capacity} &= 240\\,\\mathrm{L}\\end{align*}$$",
